This is from memory (I think from the weapons spoiler), so correct me if 
I'm wrong:

Monsters (including pets) don't pay attention to the enchantment, 
artifactness, or cursedness of weapons. They only look at the base type 
of the weapon, and they have an order of preference (assuming they can 
use them). So they'll always pick a longsword over a short sword, even 
if the long sword is cursed -7, just because they prefer longswords. 
They won't use a new longsword either, if they're already using a longsword.

That should explain your pets' actions. I would guess Angels have a 
couple extra rules such as they prefer Demonbane or something. I don't 
know of any way to make them drop items, so I don't think there's 
anything you can do about it. Maybe get a pet nymph/foocubi and conflict.

